{"seq":3,"slug":"idempotency-drift","title":"幂等性与配置漂移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/foundations/idempotency-drift","wordCount":1572,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"幂等性与配置漂移\">幂等性与配置漂移</h1><p>电梯按钮按一次和按五次，电梯都只来一次——这就是幂等。基础设施工具最珍贵的安全保证，就是它像电梯按钮一样：你对同一份配置执行一次 apply 和执行十次，世界的最终状态完全相同。少了这个保证，自动化就成了赌博——你永远不敢确定再跑一次会不会把好端端的环境搞坏。而配置漂移，则是这套幂等机器面对真实世界时不可避免漏进来的那道裂缝。这两个概念是一枚硬币的两面，本篇把它们一起讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>幂等性</strong>（idempotency）借自数学：一个操作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(f(x)) = f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即重复施加不改变结果。把它放到 IaC 语境：设系统状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，apply 操作为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，则幂等意味着对任意状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(A(s)) = A(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。第一次 apply 把系统推到期望状态，之后再 apply 都是空操作。</p>\n<p><strong>配置漂移</strong>（configuration drift）是它的反面：当真实状态在 IaC 之外被改动（有人在控制台手动改了安全组、一次紧急故障里删了实例），真实状态就偏离了代码描述的期望状态。漂移是熵——它会自发增长，是 IaC 要持续对抗的核心威胁。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[期望状态 s_desired&lt;br/&gt;代码定义] --&gt; B[apply 调和]&#10;    B --&gt; C[真实状态 = 期望状态&lt;br/&gt;系统收敛]&#10;    C --&gt; D{发生了什么}&#10;    D --&gt;|再次 apply| E[空操作&lt;br/&gt;幂等性保证]&#10;    D --&gt;|带外手工改动| F[配置漂移&lt;br/&gt;真实偏离期望]&#10;    F --&gt; G[下次 apply 检测到差异]&#10;    G --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[期望状态 s_desired&lt;br/&gt;代码定义] --&gt; B[apply 调和]\n    B --&gt; C[真实状态 = 期望状态&lt;br/&gt;系统收敛]\n    C --&gt; D{发生了什么}\n    D --&gt;|再次 apply| E[空操作&lt;br/&gt;幂等性保证]\n    D --&gt;|带外手工改动| F[配置漂移&lt;br/&gt;真实偏离期望]\n    F --&gt; G[下次 apply 检测到差异]\n    G --&gt; B</pre><p>幂等性与漂移检测其实是同一引擎的两种用法。引擎对比期望与真实，差异为空就是幂等（空操作），差异非空且非你所改就是漂移。下表厘清几组易混概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>数学/工程刻画</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>幂等</td>\n<td>重复执行结果不变</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(A(s)) = A(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛</td>\n<td>多次执行逐步逼近期望态</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{n\\to\\infty} A^n(s) = s_{desired}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lim</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂移</td>\n<td>真实态偏离期望态</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{real} \\neq s_{desired}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且非代码所致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调和</td>\n<td>把真实态推回期望态</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(s_{real}) \\to s_{desired}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>收敛比幂等弱一点：有些操作单次不一定到位，但反复执行会逼近目标，这在控制器模型里很常见，见<a href=\"../tooling/kubernetes-iac\">Kubernetes 声明式与 Crossplane</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等性为什么是安全的前提\">幂等性为什么是安全的前提</h2><p>幂等性的工程价值，体现在它让&quot;重试&quot;变得绝对安全。CI 流水线可能因网络抖动失败在一半，幂等让你直接重跑整条流水线而不必担心重复创建资源。故障恢复时你可以放心地反复执行 apply，直到环境收敛。自动化系统（如<a href=\"../practices/collaboration-workflows\">协作工作流与 IaC 的 CI/CD</a>里讲的定时 apply）依赖幂等才敢周期性运行。</p>\n<p>声明式工具天然倾向幂等，因为它们走期望状态调和——见<a href=\"declarative-vs-imperative\">声明式与命令式：期望状态模型</a>。但幂等不是自动免费的。当你用工具的命令式逃生舱口（Terraform 的 <code>provisioner</code>、Ansible 的 <code>shell</code> 模块）执行原始命令时，幂等性就由你自己负责了。一段 <code>shell: &quot;echo line &gt;&gt; /etc/hosts&quot;</code> 跑十次会追加十行——这是命令式破坏幂等的经典陷阱。配置管理工具为此提供大量&quot;声明式模块&quot;（如 Ansible 的 <code>lineinfile</code>）来恢复幂等，详见<a href=\"../tooling/config-management\">配置管理：Ansible 与可变基础设施</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"漂移-从哪来-为何危险\">漂移：从哪来，为何危险</h2><p>漂移的来源几乎总是&quot;绕过了 IaC 的带外变更&quot;（out-of-band change）。最常见的三种：故障应急时工程师直接登录控制台手动救火；其他工具或团队修改了同一组资源；云厂商自动调整了某些默认值（如给资源附加默认标签）。</p>\n<p>漂移的危险在于它是隐形的，直到下一次 apply 才暴露——而那时引擎会试图把手工救火的修改&quot;纠正&quot;回代码描述的状态，可能把救命的临时配置一并抹掉。更糟的是，如果手工改动同时让状态文件和真实世界都偏离了代码，引擎的差异计算可能给出令人意外的计划。这也是为什么状态文件的完整性如此关键，见<a href=\"../core-mechanics/state-management\">状态管理：状态文件、锁与远端后端</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对抗漂移的工程手段\">对抗漂移的工程手段</h2><p>实践中有一套组合拳来压制漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>主动检测</strong>：定期（如每天）运行只读的 <code>terraform plan</code>（或 <code>plan -detailed-exitcode</code>），任何非空计划都意味着漂移，触发告警。许多平台（如 GitOps 工具、托管 IaC 平台）把这做成了内建功能。需要注意 Atlantis 这类纯 PR 驱动的工具本身不做漂移检测，需额外配置定时任务——这一限制在<a href=\"../practices/collaboration-workflows\">协作工作流与 IaC 的 CI/CD</a>里会具体讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>封堵入口</strong>：用权限策略禁止人类直接修改生产资源，所有变更必须走 IaC 流水线。这把&quot;带外变更&quot;从技术上变得不可能，是最彻底的解法。</p>\n<p><strong>自动修复</strong>：检测到漂移后自动重新 apply，把真实态强行拉回期望态。Kubernetes 控制器是这一思想的极致——它永不停歇地调和，漂移在秒级就被纠正，几乎没有窗口期。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[定时只读 plan] --&gt; B{计划为空吗}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[无漂移&lt;br/&gt;记录通过]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[检测到漂移&lt;br/&gt;触发告警]&#10;    D --&gt; E{修复策略}&#10;    E --&gt;|人工评审| F[创建 PR 决定接受或回滚]&#10;    E --&gt;|自动修复| G[重新 apply 拉回期望态]\">flowchart TD\n    A[定时只读 plan] --&gt; B{计划为空吗}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[无漂移&lt;br/&gt;记录通过]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[检测到漂移&lt;br/&gt;触发告警]\n    D --&gt; E{修复策略}\n    E --&gt;|人工评审| F[创建 PR 决定接受或回滚]\n    E --&gt;|自动修复| G[重新 apply 拉回期望态]</pre><h2 id=\"漂移与不可变基础设施\">漂移与不可变基础设施</h2><p>不可变基础设施从根上削弱了漂移问题。如果服务器一旦创建就不再被修改、变更只靠重建，那么&quot;原地手工改动&quot;这一最大漂移来源就被堵死了——你无从在一台只读的、随时会被销毁的实例上做有意义的带外变更。这是不可变路线相对可变路线的一大优势，而可变路线（原地配置）则必须靠前述的检测与修复手段来管理漂移。两条路线的完整权衡见<a href=\"../tooling/config-management\">配置管理：Ansible 与可变基础设施</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>幂等性是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(A(s)) = A(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：重复 apply 结果不变，它让重试、恢复、定时自动化变得绝对安全。</li>\n<li>收敛是更弱的性质——多次执行逐步逼近期望态，常见于控制器调和模型。</li>\n<li>漂移是真实态在 IaC 之外被改动而偏离期望态，是会自发增长的熵，来源主要是带外手工变更。</li>\n<li>对抗漂移三板斧：主动检测（定时只读 plan）、封堵入口（权限禁止带外改动）、自动修复（重新 apply 或控制器持续调和）。</li>\n<li>命令式逃生舱口会破坏幂等，需用声明式模块恢复；不可变基础设施从根上消除最大漂移来源。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.env0.com/blog/atlantis-terraform-guide\">Atlantis Terraform Guide 2026 (env0)</a>；<a href=\"https://www.reisystems.com/automating-terraform-via-github-pull-requests-with-atlantis-for-drift-free-auditable-infrastructure/\">Automating Terraform via PRs for Drift-Free Infrastructure (REI Systems)</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"幂等性与配置漂移","id":"幂等性与配置漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等性为什么是安全的前提","id":"幂等性为什么是安全的前提"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移：从哪来，为何危险","id":"漂移-从哪来-为何危险"},{"level":2,"text":"对抗漂移的工程手段","id":"对抗漂移的工程手段"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移与不可变基础设施","id":"漂移与不可变基础设施"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"声明式与命令式：期望状态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/foundations/declarative-vs-imperative"},"next":{"title":"状态管理：状态文件、锁与远端后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/core-mechanics/state-management"}}